{"type": "tool_result", "call_id": "call_0000", "name": "lookup_knowledge", "output": "{\"query\": \"Compare the prompt agent harness and hosted agent harness costs to operate and what each gives you\", \"passages\": [{\"text\": \"What the gateway does not tell you\\n\\nThe gateway does not log tool traces. Tool-level detail comes only from Foundry tracing, which lands\\nin Application Insights. Voice Live traffic never passes through any gateway.\", \"source\": \"gateway.md\", \"score\": 1.5357}, {\"text\": \"Gateway and tracing\", \"source\": \"gateway.md\", \"score\": 1.0}, {\"text\": \"The AgentEvent contract\\n\\nNine event types: reasoning_summary, text_delta, tool_call, tool_result, mcp_call, usage, trace_ids,\\nerror and done. Every harness emits only these; the BFF and frontend consume only these.\", \"source\": \"architecture.md\", \"score\": 0.7258}]}"}
